{
  "_comment": [
    "Rules are evaluated top-to-bottom for each LocationData.json key.",
    "First the 'drop' regexes are tested; any match removes the entry entirely.",
    "Then 'categories' are tested in order and the first matching one wins.",
    "If a matched category has 'subcategories', its subcategory list is then",
    "tested in order; the first matching subcategory becomes the bucket. If no",
    "subcategory matches but the parent did, the entry goes to that parent's",
    "fallback subcategory (auto-created as '<parent>_other').",
    "Anything that matches no category falls through to the global 'other' bucket",
    "so we never silently lose data.",
    "Regex is tested with re.search against the asset class portion of the key",
    "(everything before _UAID_ for placed actors, or before :: for foliage instances)."
  ],
